-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §40 גמול ליווי טיולים: the trips allowance is
-- paid by the agreement of 8.9.98, but only for hours beyond the new work
-- hours of part ו. The agreement of 8.9.98 is the one with הסתדרות המורים
-- (imported: 1998-09-08_histadrut-hamorim_out-of-school-activity_livui-tiyulim-gmul):
-- its reward for an activity, in units by the hour the activity ends, each
-- 0.7% of the monthly combined salary.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT `1998-09-08_histadrut-hamorim_out-of-school-activity_livui-tiyulim-gmul`
§ `40 גמול ליווי טיולים`

-- The hours of the escort beyond the work hours of part ו.
@ref akn:art_40
GIVEN `hours escorting the trip` IS A NUMBER, `of them within the work hours of part ו` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `trip hours the allowance is paid for` `hours escorting the trip` `of them within the work hours of part ו` IS
    max 0 (`hours escorting the trip` MINUS `of them within the work hours of part ו`)

-- The allowance: the agreement of 8.9.98's reward for the activity (its
-- §§4.ב–4.ד, 4.ט), where some of its hours are beyond the work hours;
-- nothing where all are within them.
-- F-ofek-hadash-base-40-a: the agreement of 8.9.98 pays by the hour an
-- activity ends, not by its hours, and §40 says only that the allowance is
-- paid for the hours beyond the work hours. The reading adopted (convention
-- reading.as-printed): §40 adds a condition and changes no amount — an
-- activity that runs past the work hours earns the units the agreement of
-- 8.9.98 gives the hour it ends, and one that ends within them earns none.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A `1998 Oz out-of-school activity` @desc the activity, by the kinds of §4.ב of the agreement of 8.9.98
      `the monthly combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `a של"ח teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
      `hours escorting the trip` IS A NUMBER
      `of them within the work hours of part ו` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the trips allowance` d a `the monthly combined salary` `a של"ח teacher` `hours escorting the trip` `of them within the work hours of part ו` IS
    IF `trip hours the allowance is paid for` `hours escorting the trip` `of them within the work hours of part ו` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN `the 1998 Histadrut reward for an activity` d a `the monthly combined salary` `a של"ח teacher`
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `trip hours the allowance is paid for` 12 6 EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `trip hours the allowance is paid for` 5 6 EQUALS 0

-- An activity to 20:00, 12 hours of them 6 in the work hours: the 3.5 units
-- of 8.9.98 at 70 each; one wholly within the work hours, nothing.
#ASSERT `the trips allowance` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2009) (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 20) 10000 FALSE 12 6 EQUALS 245
#ASSERT `the trips allowance` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2009) (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 15) 10000 FALSE 6 6 EQUALS 0

-- F-ofek-hadash-base-40-a's evidence: two escorts ending at 20:00, one with
-- 6 hours beyond the work hours and one with 3, are paid the same — the
-- agreement of 8.9.98 has no column for hours — so the hours §40 counts
-- set no amount of their own.
`§40 counts hours and the agreement of 8.9.98 pays by the hour an activity ends` MEANS
        `trip hours the allowance is paid for` 12 6 GREATER THAN `trip hours the allowance is paid for` 9 6
    AND `the trips allowance` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2009) (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 20) 10000 FALSE 12 6
            EQUALS `the trips allowance` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2009) (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 20) 10000 FALSE 9 6
#ASSERT `§40 counts hours and the agreement of 8.9.98 pays by the hour an activity ends`
